      "side": 1,
      "message": "What happens when a synchronous fetch cannot acquire the project lock?\n\nWe don\u0027t reschedule it anymore, which makes sense, but we also swallow the exception. Wouldn\u0027t this cause the synchronous fetch to return successfully and the broker message to be acknowledged even though we didn\u0027t fetch anything?\n\nI think we should propagate the failure so the consumer can leave the message unacknowledged.\nWDYT?",
